    "sourceString": "~5 days",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational half-life reference for Tirzepatide."
  },
  "peptideContentTirzepatideNotes": "많은 국가에서 처방이 필요한 의약품입니다. 일반적인 증량 간격은 4주이며, 승인된 용법은 주 1회 피하 투여입니다.",
  "@peptideContentTirzepatideNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for Tirzepatide; preserve non-prescriptive framing.",
    "sourceString": "Prescription only in most countries. Standard titration is 4-week increments. Injected subcutaneously once weekly.",
    "sourceDescription": "Neutral educational notes for Tirzepatide; preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentRetatrutideDescription": "Retatrutide는 GIP, GLP-1 및 글루카곤 수용체를 표적으로 하는 연구용 삼중 작용제입니다. 2상 임상시험에서는 기존 GLP-1 기반 치료법을 능가하는 체중 감소 효과가 보고됐다.",
  "@peptideContentRetatrutideDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for Retatrutide.",
    "sourceString": "Retatrutide is an investigational triple agonist targeting GIP, GLP-1, and glucagon receptors. Phase 2 trials reported weight reductions exceeding those of existing GLP-1-based therapies.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Retatrutide."
  },
  "peptideContentRetatrutideTypicalDose": "승인된 투여 요법이 없습니다. Retatrutide는 연구 단계이며, 임상시험에서 보고된 용량은 연구 참고 정보일 뿐 사용 지침이 아닙니다.",
  "@peptideContentRetatrutideTypicalDose": {
    "description": "Investigational status text for Retatrutide; preserve no-approved-dosing and not-instructions wording.",
    "sourceString": "No approved dosing regimen. Retatrutide is investigational; amounts reported in trials are study references, not instructions for use.",
    "sourceDescription": "Investigational status text for Retatrutide; preserve no-approved-dosing and not-instructions wording."
  },
  "peptideContentRetatrutideHalfLife": "~6일",
  "@peptideContentRetatrutideHalfLife": {
    "description": "Educational half-life reference for Retatrutide.",
    "sourceString": "~6 days",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational half-life reference for Retatrutide."
  },
  "peptideContentRetatrutideNotes": "아직 조사 중입니다. 이 글을 쓰는 시점에는 FDA의 승인을 받지 않았습니다. 임상 시험 이외의 용도는 엄격히 연구용으로만 사용됩니다.",
  "@peptideContentRetatrutideNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for Retatrutide; preserve non-prescriptive framing.",
    "sourceString": "Still investigational — not FDA approved at time of writing. Any use outside a clinical trial is strictly research-only.",
    "sourceDescription": "Neutral educational notes for Retatrutide; preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentIpamorelinDescription": "Ipamorelin은 펜타펩타이드 그렐린 모방 및 선택적 성장 호르몬 분비촉진제입니다. 코티솔이나 프로락틴에 최소한의 영향을 미치면서 박동성 GH 방출을 자극하는 능력이 조사되었습니다.",
  "@peptideContentIpamorelinDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for Ipamorelin.",
    "sourceString": "Ipamorelin is a pentapeptide ghrelin-mimetic and selective growth-hormone secretagogue. It has been investigated for its ability to stimulate a pulsatile GH release with minimal effect on cortisol or prolactin.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Ipamorelin."
  },
  "peptideContentIpamorelinTypicalDose": "주사당 200~300mcg",
  "@peptideContentIpamorelinTypicalDose": {
    "description": "Reference amount text for Ipamorelin; this is not a dosing recommendation.",
    "sourceString": "200–300 mcg per injection",
    "sourceDescription": "Reference amount text for Ipamorelin; this is not a dosing recommendation."
  },
  "peptideContentIpamorelinHalfLife": "~2시간",
  "@peptideContentIpamorelinHalfLife": {
    "description": "Educational half-life reference for Ipamorelin.",
    "sourceString": "~2 hours",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational half-life reference for Ipamorelin."
  },
  "peptideContentIpamorelinNotes": "시너지 효과가 있는 GH 펄스를 위해 일반적으로 CJC-1295(DAC 없음)와 스택됩니다. 일반적인 타이밍: 잠자리에 들기 전 및/또는 공복에 운동하기 전.",
  "@peptideContentIpamorelinNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for Ipamorelin; preserve non-prescriptive framing.",
    "sourceString": "Commonly stacked with CJC-1295 (no DAC) for a synergistic GH pulse. Typical timing: before bed and/or pre-workout on an empty stomach.",
    "sourceDescription": "Neutral educational notes for Ipamorelin; preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295DacDescription": "CJC-1295는 합성 GHRH 유사체입니다. DAC(Drug Affinity Complex) 변종은 혈청 알부민에 결합하여 반감기를 연장하고 별개의 펄스가 아닌 지속적인 GH 수준을 생성합니다.",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295DacDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for CJC-1295 (with DAC).",
    "sourceString": "CJC-1295 is a synthetic GHRH analogue. The DAC (Drug Affinity Complex) variant binds to serum albumin, extending its half-life and producing sustained GH levels rather than discrete pulses.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for CJC-1295 (with DAC)."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295DacTypicalDose": "매주 1~2mg",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295DacTypicalDose": {
    "description": "Reference amount text for CJC-1295 (with DAC); this is not a dosing recommendation.",
    "sourceString": "1–2 mg weekly",
    "sourceDescription": "Reference amount text for CJC-1295 (with DAC); this is not a dosing recommendation."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295DacHalfLife": "~8일",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295DacHalfLife": {
    "description": "Educational half-life reference for CJC-1295 (with DAC).",
    "sourceString": "~8 days",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational half-life reference for CJC-1295 (with DAC)."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295DacNotes": "지속형으로, 연구 프로토콜에서는 주 1~2회 사례가 언급됩니다. 급격한 펄스보다 기저 GH/IGF-1 수치를 지속적으로 높이는 것으로 설명됩니다.",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295DacNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for CJC-1295 (with DAC); preserve non-prescriptive framing.",
    "sourceString": "Long-acting — typically dosed once or twice per week. Elevates baseline GH/IGF-1 rather than producing sharp pulses.",
    "sourceDescription": "Neutral educational notes for CJC-1295 (with DAC); preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295NoDacDescription": "DAC가 없는 CJC-1295(Mod-GRF(1-29)라고도 함)는 반감기가 짧은 GHRH 아날로그입니다. 이는 일반적으로 자연적인 박동성 GH 방출을 유발하기 위해 Ipamorelin과 같은 GHRP와 결합됩니다.",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295NoDacDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for CJC-1295 (no DAC).",
    "sourceString": "CJC-1295 without DAC — also known as Mod-GRF(1-29) — is a GHRH analogue with a short half-life. It is typically combined with a GHRP such as Ipamorelin to trigger natural pulsatile GH release.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for CJC-1295 (no DAC)."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295NoDacTypicalDose": "주사당 100mcg",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295NoDacTypicalDose": {
    "description": "Reference amount text for CJC-1295 (no DAC); this is not a dosing recommendation.",
    "sourceString": "100 mcg per injection",
    "sourceDescription": "Reference amount text for CJC-1295 (no DAC); this is not a dosing recommendation."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295NoDacHalfLife": "~30분",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295NoDacHalfLife": {
    "description": "Educational half-life reference for CJC-1295 (no DAC).",
    "sourceString": "~30 minutes",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational half-life reference for CJC-1295 (no DAC)."
  },
  "peptideContentCjc1295NoDacNotes": "단기 작용형으로, GH 펄스와 관련해 GHRP(Ipamorelin, GHRP-2, GHRP-6)와의 병용이 연구 커뮤니티에서 언급됩니다. 공복에 하루 1~3회 사용한 사례도 있습니다.",
  "@peptideContentCjc1295NoDacNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for CJC-1295 (no DAC); preserve non-prescriptive framing.",
    "sourceString": "Short acting — stack with a GHRP (Ipamorelin, GHRP-2, GHRP-6) to amplify GH pulses. Usually dosed 1–3x per day on an empty stomach.",
    "sourceDescription": "Neutral educational notes for CJC-1295 (no DAC); preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentTesamorelinDescription": "테사모렐린은 HIV 관련 지방이영양증(상표명 Egrifta)에서 과도한 복부 내장 지방을 감소시키는 데 승인된 안정화된 GHRH 유사체입니다. 인지 노화 맥락에서도 연구되었습니다.",
  "@peptideContentTesamorelinDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for Tesamorelin.",
    "sourceString": "Tesamorelin is a stabilised GHRH analogue approved to reduce excess abdominal visceral fat in HIV-associated lipodystrophy (brand name Egrifta). It has also been studied in cognitive ageing contexts.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Tesamorelin."
  },
  "peptideContentTesamorelinTypicalDose": "매일 1~2mg",
